        <activityName xml:lang="en">Road construction, surface concrete layer, installation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Road construction, surface concrete layer, installation
Modern European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: 348fd268-d51e-4548-bd58-09d670d328e6
This process represents the installation of one ton of surface concrete layer in road construction, including the laying and compaction activities.
Location: Europe
Technology: Generic process for different types of concrete surface layer and varying shares of recycled concrete
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_348fd268-d51e-4548-bd58-09d670d328e6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
